      "message": "Using SkGetExecutablePath from SkSLModuleLoader.cpp is going to require either:\n1) Adding SkGetExecutablePath to the core Skia build (ick)\n2) Make SkGetExecutablePath return a std::string instead of a SkString.\n\nI\u0027m also looking into copying the files into the Bazel exec/working directory, but it appears to make things more complex than I would like.",
